{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfZcMSbFpyUYtRhV7Yf2v","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests passed. The command result shows:\n- **Tests run: 17, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0**\n- **BUILD SUCCESS**\n\nThe ShipmentControllerTest now has 9 tests total (5 original + 4 new for the confirm endpoint).\n\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✅ **Existing build passes** — BUILD SUCCESS reported by mvnw test\n2. ✅ **Existing tests pass** — 5 original ShipmentControllerTest tests all passed, plus OrderControllerTest and CustomerControllerTest all passed\n3. ✅ **POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm confirms a created shipment and persists it** — Test `confirms a CREATED shipment and changes status to CONFIRMED` verifies the endpoint exists and persists the status change\n4. ✅ **Error responses are consistent with the rest of this API** — Uses ConflictException and ResourceNotFoundException, same as other endpoints, handled by GlobalExceptionHandler\n5. ✅ **A repeated confirm succeeds; a cancelled shipment is refused; an unknown id is refused** — Tests cover all three cases:\n   - `allows repeated confirm of a CONFIRMED shipment (idempotent)` - verifies idempotency\n   - `rejects confirm of a CANCELLED shipment with 409 conflict` - verifies 409 response with correct error code\n   - `rejects confirm of a nonexistent shipment with 404` - verifies 404 response\n6. ✅ **No new Maven dependency appears** — Only Kotlin code changes, no pom.xml modifications\n7. ✅ **No unrelated production file changes** — Only changed:\n   - ApiError.kt: Added necessary error code SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM_WHEN_CANCELLED\n   - ShipmentController.kt: Added confirm endpoint\n   - ShipmentControllerTest.kt: Added confirm tests (allowed per constraint)\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n1. **ApiError.kt** — Added `SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM_WHEN_CANCELLED` error code. This is a necessary infrast